# WN22-AC-000060: Windows Server 2022 minimum password age must be configured to at least one day.
# Source: Windows Server 2022 STIG r8
# Severity: medium
# Generated from 01-extract/output/windows-server-2022-stig-r8-controls.json

META
    esp_id `win2022-wn22-ac-000060-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `windows`
    criticality `high`

    title `Windows Server 2022 minimum password age must be configured to at least one day.`
    description `Permitting passwords to be changed in immediate succession within the same day allows users to cycle passwords through their history database. This enables users to effectively negate the purpose of mandating periodic password changes.`
    author `scanset-security`
    tags `windows,server-2022,stig,medium,account-policy,security-policy`

    control_mapping `NIST-800-53:IA-5(1)(H)`
    control_objective `WN22-AC-000060`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Windows:server-2022:endpoint`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Configure the policy value for Computer Configuration >> Windows Settings >> Security Settings >> Account Policies >> Password Policy >> Minimum password age to at least "1" day.`

    component_id `comp-windows-security-policy`

    impl_IA_5_1_H `Windows Server implements IA-5(1)(H) by enforcing MinimumPasswordAge per the STIG (Minimum password age must be >= 1 day.). The ESP scanner queries the policy via the windows_security_policy CTN and fails the policy if the value does not match the STIG-required state. Remediation sets the policy via secedit or Group Policy.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT target
        policy_name `MinimumPasswordAge`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE compliant
        exists boolean = true
        value_int int >= 1
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN windows_security_policy
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF compliant
            OBJECT_REF target
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
